{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "The Studio by Copper + Cloves — Partner API",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Server-to-server API for studio partners. Every call is scoped to the partner that owns the API key, so you only see and act on bookings for your own classes."
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "/",
      "description": "This host (production: the studio website domain)"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "partnerKey": []
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Quick start",
      "description": "1. **Get an API key** from the studio admin. It starts with `ccp_` and is shown only once, so store it straight away.\n2. **Send it on every request** as `Authorization: Bearer ccp_...`.\n3. **List your classes:** `GET /api/partner/classes?from=...&to=...` returns each class with its roster.\n4. **Act on pending bookings:** `POST /api/partner/booking-action` with `confirm` or `reject`.\n5. **(Optional) Get pushed events:** register a webhook with `PUT /api/partner/webhook`, then `POST /api/partner/webhook/test` to check it.\n\n```bash\ncurl \"https://www.thestudiobycopperandcloves.in/api/partner/classes\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer ccp_YOUR_API_KEY\"\n```"
    },
    {
      "name": "Authentication",
      "description": "- **Code samples** show `YOUR_SECRET_TOKEN`: replace it with your `ccp_...` API key. To use **Test Request** here, paste your key into the Authentication box at the top.\n- **Header:** `Authorization: Bearer ccp_...` on every call.\n- **Key per partner:** a key acts for its partner, not for a person. The studio can issue several keys and revoke any of them.\n- **Server only:** keep the key on your backend. Never ship it in a browser or mobile app.\n- **Failures:** a missing, wrong or revoked key, or a deactivated partner, returns `401`.\n- **Lost or leaked key:** ask the studio to revoke it and issue a new one. Keys cannot be shown again."
    },
    {
      "name": "Rate limits",
      "description": "- **120 requests per minute** per key.\n- Over the limit returns `429` with a `Retry-After` header (seconds). Wait that long, then retry.\n- For a near-live roster, prefer webhooks over polling `/classes`."
    },
    {
      "name": "Conventions",
      "description": "- **Times** are ISO 8601. Responses are in UTC. The studio runs on IST (UTC+05:30), so you can pass `from`/`to` with a `+05:30` offset. URL-encode `+` as `%2B`.\n- **IDs** are UUIDs.\n- **Errors** are JSON: `{ \"error\": \"message\" }`.\n\n| Status | Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| `400` | Invalid input (the message says what) |\n| `401` | Missing, invalid or revoked key |\n| `403` | The booking belongs to another partner's class |\n| `404` | Booking not found, or no webhook configured |\n| `429` | Rate limited, see `Retry-After` |"
    },
    {
      "name": "Receiving webhooks",
      "description": "We POST booking events for your classes to one HTTPS endpoint you register. The event types and payloads are listed under **Webhooks** in the sidebar.\n\n### Setup\n\n1. **Register:** `PUT /api/partner/webhook` with `{ \"url\": \"https://...\" }`. Optionally pass `events` to subscribe to a subset (default: all).\n2. **Save the `secret`** from the response. It is returned only on create or when you pass `rotateSecret: true`.\n3. **Test:** `POST /api/partner/webhook/test` sends a signed `ping` right away and reports the result.\n4. **Monitor:** `GET /api/partner/webhook` shows your 20 latest events and their delivery status.\n\n### Request headers\n\n- `X-CC-Event`: the event type, e.g. `booking.confirmed`.\n- `X-CC-Delivery`: the event id. It stays the same across retries, so use it to skip duplicates.\n- `X-CC-Signature`: `t=<unix seconds>,v1=<hex>`.\n\n### Verifying the signature\n\n1. Split `X-CC-Signature` into `t` and `v1`.\n2. Reject the request if `t` is more than 5 minutes from now (replay protection).\n3. Compute `HMAC-SHA256(secret, \"<t>.<raw request body>\")` as hex. Use the raw body bytes, not re-serialized JSON.\n4. Compare with `v1` using a constant-time compare. Reject on mismatch.\n\n```js\n// Node.js (Express): app.post(\"/webhooks/copper-cloves\", express.raw({ type: \"application/json\" }), handler)\nconst crypto = require(\"crypto\");\nfunction verify(rawBody, header, secret) {\n  const { t, v1 } = Object.fromEntries(header.split(\",\").map((p) => p.split(\"=\")));\n  if (Math.abs(Date.now() / 1000 - Number(t)) > 300) return false;\n  const expected = crypto.createHmac(\"sha256\", secret).update(`${t}.${rawBody}`).digest(\"hex\");\n  return v1.length === expected.length && crypto.timingSafeEqual(Buffer.from(v1), Buffer.from(expected));\n}\n```\n\n### Responding, retries and ordering\n\n- **Reply with any 2xx within 5 seconds.** Do slow work after you respond.\n- **Redirects are not followed.** Register the final URL.\n- **Retries:** a failed delivery is retried after 1m, 5m, 30m, 2h and 12h, then dropped.\n- **Ordering:** events are sent oldest first, but a retry can land after a newer event. Order by `createdAt`.\n- **Secret rotation** applies immediately to every later delivery, including pending retries."
    },
    {
      "name": "Classes",
      "description": "Your scheduled classes and their rosters."
    },
    {
      "name": "Bookings",
      "description": "Confirm or reject bookings that wait on you."
    },
    {
      "name": "Members",
      "description": "Members who have attended your classes."
    },
    {
      "name": "Webhook setup",
      "description": "Register, test and inspect your webhook endpoint. See *Receiving webhooks* in the guide for signing and retries."
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/api/partner/classes": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "List your classes with rosters",
        "description": "Your scheduled classes in a date range, each with its roster (confirmed bookings and unpaid seat holds). Cancelled classes are excluded. Range is capped at 100 days. Defaults to the current Monday-to-Sunday week when `from` or `to` is missing.",
        "operationId": "listClasses",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "from",
            "in": "query",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "date-time"
            },
            "example": "2026-10-19T00:00:00+05:30",
            "description": "Range start (inclusive), ISO 8601 with offset. Defaults to this Monday. Encode `+` as `%2B` in the URL."
          },
          {
            "name": "to",
            "in": "query",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "date-time"
            },
            "example": "2026-10-25T23:59:59+05:30",
            "description": "Range end (inclusive), ISO 8601 with offset. Max 100 days after `from`. Defaults to this Sunday."
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Classes ordered by start time",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Class"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited"
          }
        },
        "tags": [
          "Classes"
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/partner/members": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "List members who attended your classes",
        "description": "Distinct members checked in to at least one of your classes, all time, most recent first.",
        "operationId": "listMembers",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Members",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Member"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited"
          }
        },
        "tags": [
          "Members"
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/partner/booking-action": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "Confirm or reject a pending booking",
        "description": "Acts on a booking whose `confirmationStatus` is `pending`. `confirm` emails the member a confirmation. `reject` cancels the booking, returns the class credit to the member's pass and frees the seat. Idempotent: acting on a booking that is no longer pending returns `already: true` and changes nothing.",
        "operationId": "bookingAction",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "bookingId",
                  "action"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "bookingId": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "uuid",
                    "description": "`bookings[].id` from GET /api/partner/classes"
                  },
                  "action": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "confirm",
                      "reject"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Done",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "ok": {
                      "type": "boolean"
                    },
                    "status": {
                      "type": [
                        "string",
                        "null"
                      ],
                      "description": "`confirmed` or `rejected`; when `already` is true, the booking's current confirmation status"
                    },
                    "already": {
                      "type": "boolean",
                      "description": "Present and true when the booking was not pending"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Booking is not for one of your classes",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Booking not found",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited"
          }
        },
        "tags": [
          "Bookings"
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/partner/webhook": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "Get your webhook",
        "operationId": "getWebhook",
        "description": "Current endpoint (or null) and your 20 most recent events with delivery status.",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Webhook config",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "webhook": {
                      "oneOf": [
                        {
                          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Webhook"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "null"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "availableEvents": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/WebhookEventType"
                      }
                    },
                    "recentDeliveries": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/WebhookDelivery"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited"
          }
        },
        "tags": [
          "Webhook setup"
        ]
      },
      "put": {
        "summary": "Set your webhook",
        "operationId": "setWebhook",
        "description": "Creates or replaces your endpoint. `url` must be public HTTPS. `events` defaults to all. The signing `secret` is returned only when the webhook is first created or when `rotateSecret` is true; store it, it is not shown again. Rotation takes effect immediately for every later delivery, including retries.",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "url"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "url": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "uri",
                    "example": "https://partner.example.com/webhooks/copper-cloves"
                  },
                  "events": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/WebhookEventType"
                    }
                  },
                  "rotateSecret": {
                    "type": "boolean",
                    "default": false
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Updated",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "webhook": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Webhook"
                    },
                    "secret": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "Only when created or rotated",
                      "example": "whsec_..."
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "201": {
            "description": "Created (includes `secret`)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "webhook": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Webhook"
                    },
                    "secret": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited"
          }
        },
        "tags": [
          "Webhook setup"
        ]
      },
      "delete": {
        "summary": "Remove your webhook",
        "operationId": "deleteWebhook",
        "description": "Stops all deliveries. Events not yet delivered are dropped.",
        "responses": {
          "204": {
            "description": "Removed"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited"
          }
        },
        "tags": [
          "Webhook setup"
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/partner/webhook/test": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "Send a test event",
        "operationId": "testWebhook",
        "description": "Immediately POSTs a signed `ping` event (`data: {}`) to your endpoint and reports the result. Not retried.",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Result of the attempt",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "deliveryId": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "format": "uuid"
                    },
                    "ok": {
                      "type": "boolean"
                    },
                    "responseStatus": {
                      "type": [
                        "integer",
                        "null"
                      ]
                    },
                    "error": {
                      "type": [
                        "string",
                        "null"
                      ]
                    },
                    "durationMs": {
                      "type": "integer"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "No webhook configured",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited"
          }
        },
        "tags": [
          "Webhook setup"
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "partnerKey": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "description": "Partner API key (starts with `ccp_`), sent as `Authorization: Bearer ccp_...`. Issued by the studio admin and shown only once.",
        "bearerFormat": "ccp_ API key"
      }
    },
    "responses": {
      "BadRequest": {
        "description": "Invalid input",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "Unauthorized": {
        "description": "Missing, invalid or revoked key",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "RateLimited": {
        "description": "Too many requests",
        "headers": {
          "Retry-After": {
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "description": "Seconds to wait"
          }
        },
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "Error": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "error": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "Class": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "className": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "category": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "instructorName": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "startTime": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "endTime": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "capacity": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "signups": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "Seats taken, including extra guests"
          },
          "openSpots": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "checkedInCount": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "available",
              "started",
              "completed",
              "abandoned",
              "inactive"
            ]
          },
          "bookings": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Booking"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "Booking": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "userId": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "memberName": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "email": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "phone": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "avatarUrl": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "confirmed",
              "payment_pending"
            ],
            "description": "`payment_pending` = seat held, member has not paid yet"
          },
          "confirmationStatus": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "enum": [
              "pending",
              "confirmed",
              null
            ],
            "description": "`pending` = awaiting your confirm/reject"
          },
          "checkedIn": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "checkInOutcome": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "extraGuests": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "hasWaiver": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "refundStatus": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "holdExpiresAt": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "date-time",
            "description": "When an unpaid hold is released"
          },
          "invitedByUserId": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "uuid",
            "description": "Set when another member booked this seat for them"
          }
        }
      },
      "Member": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "email": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "phone": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "sessions": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "Classes of yours they checked in to"
          },
          "lastSession": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "hasWaiver": {
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        }
      },
      "WebhookEventType": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "booking.created",
          "booking.pending_confirmation",
          "booking.confirmed",
          "booking.cancelled",
          "booking.checked_in",
          "booking.no_show"
        ]
      },
      "Webhook": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "url": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uri"
          },
          "events": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/WebhookEventType"
            }
          },
          "isActive": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "createdAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "updatedAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          }
        }
      },
      "WebhookEvent": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "id",
          "type",
          "createdAt",
          "data"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid",
            "description": "Event id. Same value in `X-CC-Delivery`; stable across retries."
          },
          "type": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/WebhookEventType"
          },
          "createdAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time",
            "description": "When the booking changed"
          },
          "data": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "booking": {
                "type": "object",
                "description": "State of the booking at the moment of the change, plus the member.",
                "properties": {
                  "bookingId": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "uuid"
                  },
                  "classScheduleId": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "uuid"
                  },
                  "userId": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "uuid"
                  },
                  "status": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "confirmed",
                      "payment_pending",
                      "cancelled",
                      "expired"
                    ]
                  },
                  "confirmationStatus": {
                    "type": [
                      "string",
                      "null"
                    ],
                    "enum": [
                      "pending",
                      "confirmed",
                      null
                    ]
                  },
                  "checkedIn": {
                    "type": "boolean"
                  },
                  "checkInOutcome": {
                    "type": [
                      "string",
                      "null"
                    ]
                  },
                  "extraGuests": {
                    "type": "integer"
                  },
                  "member": {
                    "type": [
                      "object",
                      "null"
                    ],
                    "properties": {
                      "name": {
                        "type": [
                          "string",
                          "null"
                        ]
                      },
                      "email": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "phone": {
                        "type": [
                          "string",
                          "null"
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "class": {
                "type": [
                  "object",
                  "null"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "id": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "uuid"
                  },
                  "name": {
                    "type": [
                      "string",
                      "null"
                    ]
                  },
                  "startTime": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "date-time"
                  },
                  "endTime": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "date-time"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "WebhookDelivery": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "type": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/WebhookEventType"
          },
          "bookingId": {
            "type": [
